WEBVTT

00:09:57.372 --> 00:10:00.166
AYGTK: "... you are a part of the show."

00:10:01.071 --> 00:10:03.141
Performing the archive in "At Buffalo"

00:10:03.165 --> 00:10:05.768
allows audiences to ask themselves,

00:10:05.792 --> 00:10:08.307
"Are we still inside the gates,

00:10:08.331 --> 00:10:12.929
and are we all still part of the show?"

00:10:17.072 --> 00:10:20.485
(Music ends)

00:10:20.509 --> 00:10:27.396
(Applause and cheers)